INFO  [Claude Code] 
INFO  [Claude Code] **Solution**: Enhanced the existing `createConnectedOrderEntry()` factory method in `OrderEntryTestFactory.java` to:
INFO  [Claude Code] - Properly establish a connected socket pair (client and server side)
